  "content": "\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:24px\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/q4akN1Q.png\" alt=\"宣传图片\" width=\"1127\" height=\"597\"></strong></span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:24px\"><strong>关于</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Prismarine 是 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/customization/bsl-shaders\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">BSL Shaders</a> 的修改版。旨在以适度的性能开销提供精美的视觉效果。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:24px\"><strong>主要特性</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">- 精致的体积云雾效果（云朵、雾气、下界与末地烟雾）</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">- 自定义天空效果（星云、极光、层状云、星辰、月球烟雾）</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">- 内置 PBR 材质包</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">- 电影级模糊效果（景深、动态与远景模糊、泛光）</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">- 精美水体效果（折射、焦散、光线吸收与散射以及水下光柱）</span></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
